author=minatok20
description=Per-game performance profile for Xiaomi Mi 9T (davinci) with a WebUI to pick games and toggle each feature. Raises CPU/GPU/DDR floors (no overclock), speeds up big-core migration and top-app scheduling, and enables the hardware touch game mode; reverts on exit.
